<title>PHILIPPINES: Sime says Jul-Dec net at 69.94 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Sime says Jul-Dec net at 69.94 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sime Darby Pilipinas Inc said on Wednesday it posted a net income of 69.94 million pesos in the six months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The tyre-maker said in a statement that net sales in the period, which is the first half of its 1996-97 fiscal year, amounted to 17.39 million pesos.</p>
<p>Expenses in the period were 36.01 million pesos, it said.</p>
<p>Income was boosted by interest earnings, the company said.</p>
<p>Sime Darby Filipinas is a unit of Sime Darby Hong Kong ltd.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8914</p>
</text>
